OL,3,GNEWSACouncil chief executive is leaving
OL,4,Aafter 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornwall Council's chief executive "has
OL,7,Fdecided to leave her role" as after 10
OL,8,Fyears, the authority has announced.
OL,10,FKate Kennally said: "I am privileged to
OL,11,Fhave served Cornwall for 10 years,
OL,12,Fduring which time Cornwall has hosted
OL,13,Fthe G7 leaders' summit [in 2021],
OL,14,Fworked with communities to respond to
OL,15,Fthe Covid pandemic and recovered from
OL,16,Fsignificant events such as the Coverack
OL,17,Ffloods and Storm Goretti."
OL,19,FHer departure comes after she went on a
OL,20,Fleave of absence in September. An exact
OL,21,Fdate of her leaving has not been
OL,22,Fannounced.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
