OL,3,GNEWSACouncil chief executive is leaving
OL,4,Aafter 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said interim leadership
OL,7,Farrangements were in place and it would
OL,8,Frecruit a new permanent chief executive
OL,9,F"in due course".
